# Static redirects for the assets-only sneat-games Worker (replaces the old
# worker.js router). Path-only rules apply on every hostname attached to the
# Worker; the retired <game>.sneat.games hosts are moved away first by the
# zone Single Redirect (docs/cloudflare-cutover.md), except /sw.js and
# /__migrate.html.
#
# NEVER add a splat rewrite for a game directory (e.g. /reversi/* -> index.html
# 200): redirects are followed "regardless of whether or not an asset matches",
# so it would serve HTML for /reversi/_astro/*.js. Deep links are handled by
# the generated /<slug>/404.html instead.

# Default locale (en) home is the bare root.
/en          /              301
/en/         /              301
# Unprefixed legal pages -> the default locale's copy.
/privacy     /en/privacy/   301
/privacy/    /en/privacy/   301
/terms       /en/terms/     301
/terms/      /en/terms/     301
